		<content type="html" xml:base="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/viewtopic.php?p=2127#p2127"><![CDATA[
This is because Bullet ignores the gyroscopic (like most engines) term for the update of the velocity. Simply add this to your external force and you will be fine. Note that this term on the other hand can lead to instabilities and make the system explode...<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=14">Dirk Gregorius</a> — Fri Oct 13, 2006 12:19 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
